09:34.691 --> 09:36.191
<b>My apologies for being late.</b>

09:36.941 --> 09:41.661
<b>We do not know the whereabouts of 
Metal Knight or Blast, nor can we reach them.</b>

09:41.661 --> 09:45.451
<b>There's no reason to wait any longer, 
so let's begin this emergency meeting.</b>

09:45.781 --> 09:50.961
<b>You can call me Sitch. I'm with the Association, 
and I will be briefing you.</b>

09:50.961 --> 09:53.341
<b>Let's get right down to brass tacks.</b>

09:53.831 --> 09:58.341
<b>You heroes are here because you're the best of the best.</b>

09:59.381 --> 10:02.381
<b>And now, we're asking you to save the earth!</b>

10:02.931 --> 10:09.021
<b>However, even with your S-class ability, there is no guarantee of survival.</b>

10:09.431 --> 10:11.141
<b>Walking away also takes courage.</b>

10:11.141 --> 10:14.771
<b>Should you choose to do so now, 
you will retain S-class status.</b>

10:15.361 --> 10:20.781
<b>But those who stay and hear me out will not be allowed to walk away.</b>

10:20.781 --> 10:26.701
<b>You will be confined here until the incident is over in order to avoid a general panic.</b>

10:27.621 --> 10:30.701
<b>Do you all still wish to stay?{Are you all willing to hear this?}</b>

10:30.701 --> 10:36.341
<b>Whatever's going on, 
it better be worth calling all of us here.</b>

10:36.341 --> 10:40.301
<b>I skipped out on my little sister's 
piano recital for this.</b>

10:40.301 --> 10:41.841
<b>If it's a load of crap,</b>

10:42.471 --> 10:44.891
<b>I'm gonna tear this whole building apart.</b>

10:45.471 --> 10:47.891
<b>Like you could do that with that skinny stick.</b>

10:47.891 --> 10:51.191
<b>Yeah? How 'bout I bust your head open instead?</b>

10:51.191 --> 10:54.441
<b>{If you think you can, go on and try}You think you can? 
Do your worst, pillbug-head!</b>

10:54.851 --> 10:56.231
<b>You wanna go, shorty?!</b>

10:55.271 --> 10:57.441
<b>Hurry up and get on with it.</b>

10:57.441 --> 11:00.191
<b>Otherwise Mr. Pompadour{refers to the yankee's regent hairstyle} here is going to die.</b>

11:00.731 --> 11:03.951
<b>Hey, Hairpins, you siding with the girl?{hairpin is a valid and common-enough english word; capitalizing for consistency with "Mr. Pompadour"}</b>

11:04.411 --> 11:08.201
<b>The great seer, Madame Shibabawa, is dead!</b>

11:08.661 --> 11:11.501
<b>Shibabawa? Was she killed?</b>

11:11.501 --> 11:11.831
<b>No.</b>

11:12.371 --> 11:15.251
<b>While looking into the future for the next six months,</b>

11:15.251 --> 11:17.671
<b>she became agitated and had a coughing fit.</b>

11:17.671 --> 11:22.971
<b>She popped a cough drop in her mouth 
and ended up choking on it…</b>

11:22.971 --> 11:23.591
<b>I get it!</b>

11:24.301 --> 11:28.641
<b>So we have to figure out how to prevent disasters 
without the help of predictions.</b>

11:28.641 --> 11:30.851
<b>That's the focus of this meeting.</b>

11:31.221 --> 11:32.561
<b>No.</b>

11:32.561 --> 11:36.611
<b>Madame Shibabawa was only able to predict a handful of disasters.</b>

11:37.021 --> 11:37.941
<b>Excuse me!</b>

11:38.651 --> 11:39.821
<b>Hey, you there.</b>

11:41.321 --> 11:44.241
<b>Who was this Shibabawa? A hero?</b>

11:44.241 --> 11:45.491
<b>You don't know?</b>

11:46.071 --> 11:48.321
<b>She was a seer. A great one at that.</b>

11:48.321 --> 11:51.501
<b>She correctly predicted 
earthquakes and monster attacks.</b>

11:52.081 --> 11:56.671
<b>We've gotten through many crises without 
Madame Shibabawa's predictions.</b>

11:56.671 --> 12:01.001
<b>But even so, we provided a bodyguard and gave her special treatment.</b>

12:01.001 --> 12:05.551
<b>Yes, because her few predictions 
were 100% accurate.</b>

12:06.221 --> 12:08.011
<b>The crux of the problem, though,</b>

12:08.011 --> 12:12.181
<b>is her last, greatest prophecy.</b>

12:12.181 --> 12:17.061
<b>Even as she choked on that final cough drop, 
she managed to leave this note.</b>

12:18.061 --> 12:21.651
<b>It is a prophecy that will absolutely come to pass.</b>

